Mozilla Firefox 155 released with Happy Eyeballs v3 and other updates The open‑source Mozilla Firefox web browser has been updated to version 155 and is now available for download.
🔍 Overview Firefox 155 is the latest release of the community‑maintained web browser. It includes support for Happy Eyeballs v3, which aims to reduce page‑load latency. The release also brings a variety of other changes. ⚙️ Key details Happy Eyeballs v3: Improves connection selection for faster page loading. Open‑source: The browser continues to be distributed under an open‑source license. Downloadable now: The new version can be obtained from Mozilla’s official download channels. 🚀 Availability Firefox 155 is ready for immediate download. Users can replace older versions or install it fresh on supported operating systems. 💡 Why it matters Faster page loading enhances the browsing experience for all users. Ongoing open‑source development ensures community transparency and continued improvement. #Firefox #OpenSource #WebBrowser
